{"3532810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gulltastrophe", "steam_appid": 3532810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans are turning your island into their vacation spot – it’s time to cause a Gulltastrophe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/extras/c3096543bbebf58f2782ce66154e1929.avif?t=1787576162\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, Dash and Poop your way to victory in this funny 3D seagull action game. Explore the island, steal food and wage <i>gullrilla warfare</i> against the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Seagull</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny humans enjoying their time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Sandbox Levels</strong> of Fun, Surprises, and Pooping Actions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different foods that give you <strong>Special Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated <strong>Squawk!</strong> button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/extras/72c6295fa4fcb714b99836c487b992ff.avif?t=1787576162\" width=300 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(P.S. No seagulls were harmed during the development of this game. Except for a few developers who did get poop on their car's windshield)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans are turning your island into their vacation spot – it’s time to cause a Gulltastrophe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/extras/c3096543bbebf58f2782ce66154e1929.avif?t=1787576162\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, Dash and Poop your way to victory in this funny 3D seagull action game. Explore the island, steal food and wage <i>gullrilla warfare</i> against the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Seagull</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny humans enjoying their time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Sandbox Levels</strong> of Fun, Surprises, and Pooping Actions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different foods that give you <strong>Special Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated <strong>Squawk!</strong> button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/extras/72c6295fa4fcb714b99836c487b992ff.avif?t=1787576162\" width=300 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(P.S. No seagulls were harmed during the development of this game. Except for a few developers who did get poop on their car's windshield)</p>", "short_description": "It’s time to cause a Gulltastrophe! Reclaim your island home: Fly, Dash and combine foods to deliver hilarious Poop combos! Play solo or with friends. And yes… you can steal fries. 🍟", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "reviews": "“Squawk Squawk Squawk Squawk”<br>9.8/10 – Seagull Community<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/header.jpg?t=1787576162", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532810/2e16b584038800ec1877